_of_Saint_Mark%27s_Basilica_of_Venice.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · This photo was taken by Roman Bonnefoy (, CC BY-SA 4.0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-26fe0e06-b623-3306-989f-710f5cb4dd6d","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"auch","category":"À voir","title":"Eglise Sainte-Radegonde","date":null,"time":"","place":"Pis, Pis","lat":43.784023,"lng":0.713858,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1791600334888,"description":"L’église et son clocher-mur datant du XVIe siècle.\r\nL'église fut reconstruite en 1862. De l'église primitive, reste le beau portail gothique, une partie du clocher et une petite statue en bois doré de Sainte-Radegonde.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/San_Alipio_facade_door_of_Saint_Mark%27s_Basilica_of_Venice.jpg/960px-San_Alipio_facade_door_of_Saint_Mark%27s_Basilica_of_Venice.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · This photo was taken by Roman Bonnefoy (, CC BY-SA 4.0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-3affdd80-c5fb-36f0-a6f7-590b3901ec35","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"auch","category":"À voir","title":"Eglise Saint-Caprais","date":null,"time":"","place":"Montestruc-sur-Gers, Montestruc-sur-Gers","lat":43.793171,"lng":0.629202,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1791600334888,"description":"L’église qui date de la fin du 19ème siècle est caractérisée par de beaux vitraux et une rosace, côté ouest.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Dresden_Garnisonkirche_gp.jpg/960px-Dresden_Garnisonkirche_gp.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · User:Kolossos, CC BY-SA 3.0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-3f4f7283-3703-39e6-a3d5-c22a23d6f1a2","isPlace":true,"scene":"